&gt; :ifp: *IFP is looking for high-agency, high-EQ operators to join our Emerging Technology team to work on finding AI talent for senior US policy roles!* :moneybag: *$3k <https://forms.gle/QPTcFzRywgrX9ym29|referral> bonus*
&gt; 
&gt; If you're the sort of generalist who'll try everything from befriending senior policymakers to designing new event series and fellowships to building automated headhunting tools, we want to hear from you.
&gt; 
&gt; The US gov needs more AI expertise in its highest-leverage positions. We recently started a project to solve this problem, and we've already helped several candidates get offers for key roles. The number of opportunities far exceeds our tracked talent pool, though, so we're scaling up!
&gt; • Apply *<https://ifp.org/opportunity/sourcing-programs-staff-ai-state-capacity/|here>* by Aug 23
&gt; • DC strongly preferred; also open to remote US
&gt; • Salary $110-250k. We're open to early and mid-career versions of this role
&gt;

&gt; 𝗛𝘂𝗴𝗲 𝗵𝗶𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗿𝗼𝘂𝗻𝗱 𝗮𝘁 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗘𝗨 𝗔𝗜 𝗢𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗲: The European Commission has just started hiring for around 40 posts dedicated to enforcing the AI Act. 
&gt; 
&gt; The call covers Technology Specialists, Legal Officers, Operations Specialists and Paralegals, recruiting primarily into two units at the centre of AI Act enforcement, one covering regulation and compliance, the other AI safety.
&gt; 
&gt; The AI Office is looking for people working on model evaluations and red-teaming, interpretability and alignment, model weight security and confidential computing, AI-enabled cyber threats, agentic AI, and compute and hardware supply chains. It is also recruiting risk-area specialists on loss of control, CBRN, cyber and harmful manipulation, alongside strategic foresight and quantitative analysis work including capability forecasting and game-theoretic modelling of regulatory and competitive dynamics.
&gt; 
&gt; The deadline is 8 September 2026. You must be an EU citizen and the place of employment is Brussels. 
&gt; 
&gt; More information here: <https://lnkd.in/p/epnpMahX|lnkd.in/p/epnpMahX>

